            "heading": "How do I measure for a worktop?",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "row_content": "<p>Measure the length along the back wall and the depth from the wall to the front edge, in millimetres. Add any overhang you want. If your walls are out of square, request a free quote and we'll help.</p>"
