          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's the difference between quartz, granite and marble?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Quartz is engineered, very consistent and low maintenance. Granite is a hard natural stone with a speckled grain. Marble is softer, with dramatic veining, and needs more care.</p>"
          }
